text = "Homecoming party. Everyone here knows your girlfriend. And then another message arrives.

[MOVE] WASD
[PROPS / DOORS] E up close
[PHONE ON] Q or message icon
[PHONE OFF] Side power button
[PAUSE] ESC

Reply by tapping the letters of the word in order. A wrong letter locks the phone for a moment.

If someone gets close while your phone is on, you're caught. Too many unread messages and it's over too. Hold out until midnight to win.

Left or right click people to react to them. You can also block their way."
autowrap_mode = 3
